Only allows specific domains:

Example rule:

URL must start with https://website.thm

🚨 Bypass:
https://website.thm.attacker.com

🔄 Open Redirect (Powerful Bypass)

If strict filtering exists, attacker can:

Use allowed domain

Redirect internally to malicious target

Example:

https://website.thm/link?url=https://attacker.com


Answer:

Open Redirect

